  "title": "cjvnjde's Glove80 Dvorak v2",
  "notes": "Version 2 of cjvnjde's personal Glove80 layout. Dvorak is implemented in keyboard firmware, so keep the host OS input layout set to US QWERTY; selecting Dvorak in the OS remaps keys twice. Includes a QWERTY fallback plus Lower, Symbol, and Magic layers for navigation, numpad/media, symbols, Bluetooth, RGB, and firmware controls. Hold Escape or Delete for Symbol; tap for Escape or Delete. Hold Enter for Lower; tap for Enter.",
